msgid "Securing endpoints"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This extension will automatically use the Security annotations within the "
"package `jakarta.annotation.security` that are defined on your resource "
"interfaces:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that this feature is provided by the REST Data with Panache extension "
"that this extension is using under the hood. So, pure Spring Boot "
"applications might not behave the same way."
msgstr ""

msgid "What is currently unsupported"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Only the repository methods listed above are supported. No other standard or "
"custom methods are supported."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Only the `exposed`, `path` and `collectionResourceRel` annotation properties "
"are supported."
msgstr ""

msgid "Important Technical Note"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Please note that the Spring support in Quarkus does not start a Spring "
"Application Context nor are any Spring infrastructure classes run.\n"
"Spring classes and annotations are only used for reading metadata and / or "
"are used as user code method return types or parameter types."
msgstr ""

